    "title": "Newmark Arranges $56M Sale of Arlington Office Building - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jasmine Kilman ,\n1 days ago Newmark has arranged the $56.25 million sale of 4075 Wilson Boulevard, a 188,014-square-foot office property in Arlington’s Ballston submarket. An institutional investor acquired the property from FarmViewVentures LLC, Rithm Capital Corp. and GreenBarn Investment Group. Newmark Capital Markets Executive Managing Directors Jud Ryan and James P. Cassidy, along with Vice President Grant Marley, represented the seller in the transaction. Read full article",
